    {
      "id": "chase-travel-redesign",
      "title": "Chase Travel Homepage",
      "description": [
        "Chase Travel serves 80M customers. 90% of customers we interviewed arrived with a destination already in mind and wanted to understand how to get the most from their credit card. Yet the homepage was dominated by generic editorial content with just 0.01% engagement."
      ],
      "description2": [
        "I redesigned the homepage around Chase Travel’s core value proposition and competitive advantage: getting more value from their Chase card. Card benefits, next best actions, and relevant recommendations helped turn travel intent into booking action."
      ],
      "metadata": [
