    {
      "id": "column",
      "title": "Business Banking Activation",
      "description": [
        "97% of new SMB customers came from Consumer Banking but entered a completely different experience. Without guidance, many missed critical setup tasks like funding their account within 60 days and enrolling in fraud protection, limiting activation and product adoption."
      ],
      "description2": [
        "I designed and shipped Chase Business Banking’s first activation experience for 7.5M+ customers: a scalable framework that prioritized high-impact actions through progressive disclosure, behavioral nudges, and a reusable checklist."
      ],
