    {
      "id": "chase-sapphire-dining",
      "title": "Chase Dining",
      "description": [
        "Dining is one of the highest-frequency card spend categories, yet Chase had no owned dining discovery experience. I helped launch a 0→1 MVP to validate whether customers would engage with a dedicated dining rewards experience."
      ],
      "description2": [
        "3M customers engaged with the MVP, and Dining became the #2 Sapphire Reserve rewards category within four months. Strong adoption helped expand the program from 30 to 60 markets and informed the long-term product vision I drove."
      ],
