    {
      "id": "runway-ai",
      "title": "Building an AI Financial Copilot",
      "description": [
        "After speaking with hundreds of small business owners, one challenge surfaced repeatedly: predicting cash flow. Financial data was available, but interpreting numbers and graphs wasn’t easy for everyone. I built Runway AI to make that data easier to understand, question, and act on."
      ],
      "description2": [
        "I took Runway from idea to working product, embedding AI directly into the financial context instead of building another chatbot. Contextual prompts narrow the model’s scope, complex insights expose their reasoning, and AI recommends actions while keeping every financial decision with the user."
      ],
      "metadata": [
