    {
      "id": "samsung",
      "title": "Access & Permissions",
      "description": [
        "As Chase’s small business customers grow, financial management becomes a team effort. But giving employees, accountants, and partners access to business banking introduces significant risk. Complex permissions made it difficult for owners to safely delegate financial access."
      ],
      "description2": [
        "I designed Chase Business Banking’s 0→1 access management platform, turning complex banking entitlements into clear decisions. Owners could see who had access, control what they could see or move, and safely delegate across accounts, cards, and payments."
      ],
      "metadata": [
        {
          "icon": "role",
          "text": "Sole Product Designer"
