    {
      "id": "klifra-step",
      "title": "Klifra Step",
      "description": [
        "Existing truck-bed steps were slow, cumbersome, and often bypassed altogether, leading operators to climb or jump from five-foot beds. For fleet operators, that meant preventable injuries, downtime, and workers’ compensation costs."
      ],
      "description2": [
        "I led customer discovery, product strategy, and pricing strategy, partnering with engineers to turn those insights into Klifra. The automated system cut truck-bed access from 39 to 7 seconds, maintained three points of contact, and differentiated from cheaper manual competitors through speed, safety, and ease of use."
      ],
      "metadata": [
        {
          "icon": "role",
          "text": "Product Manager"
        },
        {
